hadiths[34]{hadithnumber,text}:
"506","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Daus ka zikr kiya. To us ne kaha: Un ke paas jao — phir us ne un ke mardon aur auraton ka zikr kiya. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne dono hath uthae. To us aadmi ne kaha: Inna lillahi wa inna ilaihi raji'un! Daus halak ho gai, Rabb Ka'ba ki qasam! To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne dono hath uthae aur farmaya: 'Aey Allah! Daus ko hidayat de.'"
"507","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ghodon mein se shikal ko napasand farmate the."
"508","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Mere naam par naam rakho aur meri kunniyat par kunniyat na rakho.' Rawi ne kaha: Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ghodon mein se ishkal ko napasand farmate the. Shu'bah aur Abdullah bin Yazid ne kaha: Yeh Suhbani nahin hai; woh donon Nakha' mein se hain."
"509","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Allah ne us ki zamanat li hai jo meri raah mein mujahid ban kar nikle mujh par iman rakhte hue aur mere Rasool ki tasdeeq karte hue: Woh mujh par zaamin hai ke main use jannat mein dakhil karunga, ya agar main use wapas karunga to use us ajr ya ghanimat ke sath wapas karunga jo us ne paya. Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Koi banda Allah ke raste mein zakhmi nahin hota magar woh Qayamat ke din aaega jabke us ka rang khoon ka rang aur us ki khushbu mushk ki khushbu hogi. Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Agar main Musalmanon par mashaqqat na samajhta to main us lashkar se peeche na baithta jo Allah ke raste mein jang karta hai. Lekin main wus'at nahin pata ke unhen sawari dun, aur na woh wus'at pate hain, aur un par bhari hai ke woh mujh se peeche rahen. Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Beshak main chahunga ke main Allah ke raste mein jang karun phir qatl kiya jaun, phir jang karun phir qatl kiya jaun, phir jang karun phir qatl kiya jaun.'"
"510","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ham mein khateeb ban kar khade hue. To Aap ne ghulul ka zikr farmaya aur us ke muamle ko azeem farmaya. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Aey logon! Main tum mein se kisi ko Qayamat ke din na paun jabke us ki gardan par oont ho jo bhinbhinata ho. To woh kahe: Ya Rasulullah! Meri madad farmayen. To main kahunga: Main Allah ki taraf se tumhare liye kuch ka malik nahin; main ne tumhen pahuncha diya tha. Main tum mein se kisi ko Qayamat ke din na paun jabke us ki gardan par bakri ho jo mimiyati ho. To woh kahe: Ya Rasulullah! Meri madad farmayen. To main kahunga: Main Allah ki taraf se tumhare liye kuch ka malik nahin; main ne tumhen pahuncha diya tha. Main tum mein se kisi ko Qayamat ke din na paun jabke us ki gardan par ghoda ho jo hinahinata ho. To woh kahe: Aey Rasulullah meri madad farmayen! To main kahunga: Main Allah ki taraf se tumhare liye kuch ka malik nahin; main ne tumhen pahuncha diya tha. Main tum mein se kisi ko Qayamat ke din na paun jabke us ki gardan par jaan ho jo cheekhti ho. To woh kahe: Ya Rasulullah! Meri madad farmayen. To main kahunga: Main Allah ki taraf se tumhare liye kuch ka malik nahin; main ne tumhen pahuncha diya tha. Main tum mein se kisi ko Qayamat ke din na paun jabke us ki gardan par kapda ho jo phadphadata ho. To woh kahe: Ya Rasulullah! Meri madad farmayen. To main kahunga: Main Allah ki taraf se tumhare liye kuch ka malik nahin; main ne tumhen pahuncha diya tha. Main tum mein se kisi ko Qayamat ke din na paun jabke us ki gardan par sona ya chaandi ho. To woh kahe: Ya Rasulullah! Meri madad farmayen. To main kahunga: Main Allah ki taraf se tumhare liye kuch ka malik nahin; main ne tumhen pahuncha diya tha.'"
"511","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Qayamat qaim nahin hogi yahan tak ke tum Yahud se jang karo. Yahan tak ke pathar jis ke peeche Yahudi ho kahe: Aey Musalman! Yeh mere peeche Yahudi hai, to use qatl karo.'"
"512","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Mujhe hukm diya gaya hai ke main logon se jang karun yahan tak ke woh gawahi den ke Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, namaz qaim karen, aur zakat den. Phir jab woh aisa karen to un ka khoon aur un ka maal haraam ho gaya siwae us ke haq ke, aur un ka hisab Allah par hai.'"
"513","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Mujhe hukm diya gaya hai ke main logon se jang karun yahan tak ke woh kahen: La ilaha illallah.'"
"514","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Rabah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ham Mu'awiyah ke paas aae, aur hamare sath Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) the. Har din ham mein se ek aadmi qaum ke khane ka zimma leta. Woh mera din tha, to woh mere paas jama hue, jabke un ka khana pakka na tha. To Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Fath Makkah mein hazir tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: 'Aey Abu Hurairah! Mere liye Ansar ko bulao.' To main ne unhen bulaya, to woh daudte hue aae. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: 'Aey Ansar ki jama'at! Kya tum Quraish ke muntashir logon ko dekhte ho? Jab tum un se kal milo to unhen kaat kar rakh do' — Hammad (rawi) ne apne dayen hath se baen par ishara kiya — 'Phir tumhara wa'da Safa hai.' To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Khalid bin Walid ko dayen pahlu par, Zubair bin Awwam ko baen pahlu par muqarrar farmaya. Rawi ne kaha: Aur Aap ne Abu Ubaidah bin Jarrah ko wadi mein pyada lashkar par muqarrar farmaya. Rawi ne kaha: Phir jab agla din aaya to ham un se mile. Rawi ne kaha: Qaum mein se koi ziyadati karne wala na tha magar ham ne use sula diya. Rawi ne kaha: Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye fath hui yahan tak ke Aap Safa par chadhe. To Ansar aae aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Safa par gher liya. To Abu Sufyan aae aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Quraish ke bade groh halak ho gae: 'Aaj ke baad Quraish nahin.' To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo apne ghar mein dakhil hua woh aman mein hai. Jo apna hathyar dal de woh aman mein hai. Jo Abu Sufyan ke ghar mein dakhil hua woh aman mein hai. Aur jo apna darwaza band kare woh aman mein hai.' To Ansar ne kaha: Raha Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam), to Aap ko apni qaum mein rahm aur apni basti mein raghbat ne pakad liya hai. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par wahi nazil hui — phir rawi ne hadees aakhir tak isi ki misl zikr ki."
"515","[AI-translation] Affan ne kaha: Aur Sulaiman bin Mughirah ne is hadees mein kaha: Aur Aap ne Abu Ubaidah bin Jarrah ko be zirah lashkar par muqarrar farmaya — yani pyada lashkar."
"516","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Qayamat ke din sab se pahle jin mein faisla kiya jaega teen hain: Ek aadmi jo shaheed hua. To Allah use laega aur use apni ni'maten batayega, to woh unhen pahchanega. To Allah us se farmayega: To tum ne is mein kya kiya? Woh kahega: Main ne Teri raah mein jang ki yahan tak ke shaheed hua. To Allah farmayega: Tum ne jhoot kaha; lekin tum ne is liye jang ki taake kaha jae: Woh bahadur hai. Aur woh kaha ja chuka. Phir hukm diya jaega, to use us ke munh ke bal jahannam ki taraf ghaseeta jaega. Aur Allah ek aadmi ko laega jis ne ilm seekha aur sikhaya, aur Quran padha. To Allah use apni ni'maten batayega, to woh unhen pahchanega. To Allah us se farmayega: Tum ne is mein kya kiya? To woh kahega: Main ne Teri khatir Quran seekha aur sikhaya, aur Quran padha. To Allah farmayega: Tum ne jhoot kaha; lekin tum ne is liye seekha taake kaha jae: Falan aalim hai, aur falan qari hai. Aur woh kaha ja chuka. Phir hukm diya jaega, to use us ke munh ke bal jahannam ki taraf ghaseeta jaega. Aur ek aadmi laya jaega jise Allah ne har qism ke maal mein se diya tha. To Allah use us mein apni ni'maten batayega, to woh unhen pahchanega. Rawi ne kaha: To tum ne is mein kya kiya? To woh kahega: Main ne koi rasta nahin chhoda jis mein kharch karna Tu pasand farmata hai magar main ne us mein kharch kiya. To Allah farmayega: Tum ne jhoot kaha; lekin tum ne is liye chaha taake kaha jae: Woh sakhi hai. Aur woh kaha ja chuka. Phir us ke bare mein hukm diya jaega, to use us ke munh ke bal jahannam ki taraf ghaseeta jaega.'"
"517","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Allah ke qaul: «خَيْرَ أُمَّةٍ أُخْرِجَتْ لِلنَّاسِ» [3-Ale Imran:110] ke bare mein riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Ham unhen zanjeeron mein layenge phir unhen Islam mein dakhil karenge.'"
"518","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jab woh Tabuk ke ghazwe se wapas aae jabke Aap ki sawari Aap ke aage thi, aur woh kaanp uthi jab ek dehati mote taze oonton ke sath guzra jabke woh rajaz padh raha tha. To ek aadmi ne kaha: Agar is ki chusti aur taqat Allah ke raste mein hoti. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Agar us ki chusti aur taqat us ke walidain ki taraf wapas ho taake woh unhen be-niyaz kare aur un ki kifayat kare to woh Allah ke raste mein hai. Aur agar us ke ghar walon aur bachche ki taraf wapas ho to woh Allah ke raste mein hai. Aur agar fakhr aur kasrat maal ke liye ho to woh Taghut ke raste mein hai.'"
"519","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Allah ki qasam! Beshak Allah ke raste mein subah ya shaam nikalna duniya aur jo us mein hai us se behtar hai.'"
"520","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Mahrum woh hai jo Kalb ki ghanimat se mahrum hua.'"
"521","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo Allah ke raste mein zakhmi hote hue nikle, woh Qayamat ke din aaega jabke rang khoon ka rang aur khushbu mushk ki khushbu hogi.'"
"522","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Beshak Allah ka ghazab us aadmi par sakht hai jise Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qatl kiya. Aur Allah ka ghazab us aadmi par sakht hai jis ne Malikul Amlak naam rakha; Allah ke siwa koi badshah nahin.'"
"523","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rifa'ah bin Zaid Juzami ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko ek ghulam tohfe mein diya. To woh us ke sath Khaibar ki taraf nikle. Jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Khaibar se wapas aae to Aap shaam mein asr aur maghrib ke darmiyan wadi ke kinare utre. To ghulam khada hua Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki sawari ka kajawa taiyar karne laga. To achanak ek anjana teer aaya aur use laga aur use qatl kar diya. To ham ne kaha: Tumhen jannat mubarak ho! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Hargiz nahin! Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Beshak us ki chadar us par jahannam mein shola ban kar bhadak rahi hai.' Aur us ne use Khaibar ke din Musalmanon ke fai' mein se khiyanat ki thi. Rawi ne kaha: To Aap ke sahaba mein se ek aadmi ghabraya hua aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main ne apne donon jooton ke do tasme liye the. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Tumhare liye jahannam mein isi jaisi taiyar ki jayengi.'"
"524","[AI-translation] Hazrat Rabi' bint Mu'az bin Afra (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath jang karti thin; ham unhen pani pilatin, un ki khidmat kartin, aur shaheedon aur zakhmiyon ko Madina wapas layatin.'"
"525","[AI-translation] Ata bin Yasar (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke ek aurat ne unhen bataya, us ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) soe, phir bedar hue jabke hans rahe the. Us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya Aap meri wajah se hanse? To Aap ne farmaya: 'Nahin, lekin meri ummat mein se ek qaum ki wajah se jo samandar mein jang karegi; un ki misal takhton par badshahon ki si hai.' Phir Aap soe, phir bedar hue jabke hans rahe the. Aap ne farmaya: 'Meri ummat mein se ek qaum samandar mein jang ke liye niklegi; un ki ghanimaten thodi hongi, unhen bakhsh diya jaega.' Us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Allah se dua karen ke woh mujhe un mein se bana de. To Aap ne un ke liye dua farmai. To Ata bin Yasar (Rahimahullah) ne hamen bataya ke unhon ne us aurat ko Munzir bin Zubair ke ghazwe mein dekha jo Rome ki sarzameen ki taraf tha; woh un ke sath thin aur Rome ki sarzameen mein faut huin."
"526","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik se Umm Haram bint Milhan (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) soe phir bedar hue, phir unhon ne isi ki manind zikr ki."
"527","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Yazid se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo Allah ke raste mein ghoda bandhe aur us par sawab ki niyyat se kharch kare, to us ka sair hona, bhooka hona, pyasa hona, sairab hona, peshab aur leed Qayamat ke din us ke meezan mein hoga.'"
"528","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Atiyyah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath subah jang ke liye nikalti thin. Main ne Aap ke sath saat ghazwat mein jang ki. To main un ke kajawon mein un ki jagah rahti; main un ke liye khana banati aur un ke zakhmiyon ka ilaj karti.'"
"529","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Atiyyah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath saat ghazwat mein jang ki. To main un ke liye khana banati, beemaron ki dekhbhal karti, aur zakhmiyon ka ilaj karti.'"
"530","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Waraqah bint Abdullah bin Haris Ansariyyah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai — aur unhon ne Quran jama kiya tha — aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab Badr ke liye nikle to unhon ne Aap se kaha: Kya Aap mujhe ijazat dete hain ke main Aap ke sath niklun? Main Aap ke zakhmiyon ka ilaj karungi aur Aap ke beemaron ki dekhbhal karungi; shayad mujhe shahadat ata ho. Aap ne farmaya: 'Beshak Allah ne tumhare liye shahadat taiyar kar rakhi hai.' To Aap unhen Shaheedah kahte. Aur Aap ne unhen hukm diya tha ke woh apne ghar walon ki imamat karen. Un ka muazzin tha. To woh apne ghar walon ki imamat karti rahin yahan tak ke un ki laundi aur un ke ghulam ne unhen qatl kar diya — unhon ne un donon ko apne baad aazad karne ka wa'da kiya tha — to un donon ne unhen Umar ke daur mein qatl kar diya. To mashhoor hua ke Umm Waraqah qatl ki gayin; un ke ghulam aur un ki laundi ne unhen qatl kiya. To Umar logon mein khade hue aur kaha: Beshak Umm Waraqah ko un ki laundi aur un ke ghulam ne qatl kar diya yahan tak ke unhen qatl kar diya, aur beshak woh donon bhag gae. To un donon ko laya gaya, aur unhen sooli di gai. To woh donon Madina mein sab se pahle sooli diye gae the. Phir Umar ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sach farmaya. Aap farmate the: 'Hamare sath chalo, ham Shaheedah ki ziyarat karenge.'"
"531","[AI-translation] Khabbab ki beti se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Mere walid Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein ek ghazwe mein nikle. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamari dekhbhal farmate yahan tak ke hamari ek bakri dohte. Aap bade pyale mein dohte aur woh bhar jata. To Khabbab aae aur woh use dohte, to us ka doodh wapas ho gaya.'"
"532","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Meri madad Saba se ki gai, aur Aad Dabur se halak kiye gae."
"533","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mujahid (Rahimahullah) se Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne pichli ki manind hadees bayan farmai."
"534","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ata (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Najdah Haruri ne Ibn Abbas ko khat likha jis mein us ne bachchon ke qatl, aur bachcha kab yatimi ke ahkam se nikalta hai, aur auraton ke bare mein ke kya woh qital mein hazir hongi, aur khums, aur ghulam ke bare mein ke kya us ke liye maal ghanimat mein hissa hai? To unhon ne mujhe likha: Raha bachche, to agar tum Khizr ho jo momin ko kafir se pahchante ho to use qatl karo. Aur raha bachcha, to beshak us se yatimi jab khatm hoti hai jab woh muhtalim ho. Aur rahin aurten, to beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) unhen apne sath nikalte; woh beemaron ka ilaj kartin, zakhmiyon ki dekhbhal kartin, aur qital mein hazir hotin. Aur raha khums, to beshak ham ne kaha: Woh hamara hai, lekin hamari qaum ne ham se woh qabool nahin kiya. Aur raha ghulam, to use maal ghanimat mein se hissa diya jata tha."
"535","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne un logon ka zikr kiya jinhen Ali ne jalaya. To unhon ne kaha: Agar main hota to main unhen na jalata. Kyunke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ke azab se azab na do. Aur main unhen zaroor qatl karta. Kyunke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apna deen badle use qatl karo."
"536","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne aisa aur aisa kiya, ya aisa aur aisa aaya. To jawan us ki taraf daud pade, aur budhe jhandon ke neeche sabit rahe. Phir jab Allah ne unhen fath di to jawan aae jo un ke liye muqarrar kiya gaya tha mangne lage. Aur budhon ne kaha: Beshak ham tumhare madadgar the, aur ham jhandon ke neeche the. To Allah Azza wa Jalla ne nazil farmaya: «یَسْئَلُوْنَكَ عَنِ الْاَنْفَالِ قُلِ الْاَنْفَالُ لِلّٰهِ وَالرَّسُوْلِ فَاتَّقُوْا اللّٰهَ وَاَصْلِحُوْا ذَاتَ بَیْنِکُمْ»."
"537","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se isi ki misl riwayat hai, aur izafa kiya, unhon ne kaha: Beshak ham tumhare madadgar the; aur agar tum zahir hue to hamari wajah se zahir hue."
"538","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Badr ke din farmaya: Jis ne aisa aur aisa kiya, to us ke liye aisa aur aisa hoga. To jawan mard gae, aur budhe jhandon ke neeche sabit rahe. Phir jab Allah ne unhen fath di to jawan apna nafal mangne aae. Aur budhon ne kaha: Beshak ham jhandon ke neeche the, aur ham tumhare madadgar the; agar tum shikast khate, to tum ham par tarjeeh na dete. To Allah ne nazil farmaya: «یَسْئَلُوْنَكَ عَنِ الْاَنْفَالِ قُلِ الْاَنْفَالُ لِلّٰهِ» — Aap ne tilawat ki yahan tak ke pahunche «کَمَا اَخْرَجَكَ رَبُّكَ مِنْ بَیْتِكَ بِالْحَقِّ وَاِنَّ فَرِیْقًا مِّنَ الْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ لَکٰرِهُوْنَ». To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un ke darmiyan barabar taqseem farmaya."
"539","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Badr ke din farmaya jabke Aap khaime mein the: Aey Allah! Beshak main Tujh se Tera ahad aur Tera wa'da mangta hun. To Abu Bakr ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne apne Rabb se apni munt ka kuch hissa shadeed kar diya. — Aur Aap zirah mein the. — To Aap nikle jabke farma rahe the: «وَلَهٗ الْکِبْرِیَاءُ فِی السَّمَوٰتِ» aur «بَلِ السَّاعَةُ مَوْعِدُهُمْ وَالسَّاعَةُ اَدْهٰی وَاَمَرَّ»."
